  "change": [
    "Recognize only the already-created supported legacy edge and completed cached receipt from unchanged immutable evidence.",
    "Require exact signed ingress, native acknowledgment, original protected operator bytes and pre-ingress producer/deployment proof.",
    "Bind the original completed gateway session_id and call_id while allowing later ordinary call receipts.",
    "Preserve both original markers and deny any third additional recovery unit; normal verified repair/action and QA boundaries remain independent.",
    "Readiness and QA rederive original tests/evidence and current authority; no canonical alias, copied artifact, new authorization or delivery mutation is created by the reader.",
    "Prepare a minimal private proposal from actual Root rollout records; retain only exact content-addressed objects, create-only, index last."
